Vendored from CLDR release-41, unicode-org/cldr, keyboards/osx/:

  en-t-k0-osx.xml   the macOS U.S. layout: every key, in all eight modifier
                    combinations, plus the layout's own dead keys
  _platform.xml     ISO key position <-> macOS virtual key code

